      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "6801f052-da94-0b6f-183e-ea1fdf2159b5"],
     ") become properties?"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"0daf8e98-7628-e40b-3b54-27c203c2cf51"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     StyleBox["They stay functions",
      FontWeight->"Bold"],
     " and can also be asked of a code as properties"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"7b6211f5-475c-1194-2911-88bf72e963fe"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "7c8f7bdf-2493-8d8a-24b5-72994d27d7d0"], Cell[
    "C", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"14e8dcaf-74c9-37ba-3c97-d5097d7d9d80"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     "Does ",
