  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],
 " (10 qubits by default) with a message saying what to use instead:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"],

